<div class="page">
    <h2 style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 30px;">THE IMPORTANCE OF GRAPHIC STANDARDS</h2>
    <div class="content">
        <p>The visual identity of <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span>' graphic standards guide is a resource for all members of <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span> and the vendors who work with the University. The graphics standards guide has been created to ensure consistent and appropriate use of <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span>' logos. The graphic standards set forth in this document provide a set of guidelines in order to allow the Athletics Department to effectively communicate its unique identity to all key constituents.</p>
        <p>This set of marks is meant to visually represent and build upon the tradition and pride associated with <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span>. The <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span> and the <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span> are the primary identifiers, but secondary marks provide flexibility and create a strong family of images.</p>
        <p>Graphics standards provide a sound, flexible structure for using logos, color and typography. Consistent brand messaging is essential and graphic standards will help ensure the <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span> brand will continue to be recognized.</p>
        <p>This document contains the usage guidelines, logos, typography marks and application examples in regards to the departments visual identity. In addition, directions on how to obtain electronic versions of the marks are included.</p>
        <p>For questions about the graphic standards guide or for more information about the visual identity, please contact <span data-field="department_name">{{ department_name }}</span> offices at <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span>.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
