            <p style="font-size: 14px;">In addition to the primary colors, the <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span> utilize black, gold and green.</p>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
                <div style="width: 80px; height: 60px; background-color: #000000; border: 1px solid #000;"></div>
