    <div class="content">
        <p>The <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span> marks were designed to create a consistent brand for the <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span> Department. These marks should not be changed or altered in any way and their use must adhere to standards in this manual. At the same time, there are many logo variations to choose from so there should be a design compatible to any application.</p>
        <p>All of the <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span> may be reproduced in full color, two colors (where applicable), black, white and red. The full color logos are shown on the left.</p>
        <p>These logos are intended for use by the <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span> department. Permission is required for use by any other entity.</p>
