<div class="page">
    <h2 style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 30px;">LU PRIMARY ATHLETICS MARKS USE ON COLORED BACKGROUNDS</h2>
    <div class="content">
        <p>Frequently it may be desirable to place the <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span> on a colored background. As shown in the examples on the left, the artwork has been created with a built-in outline shape allowing it to work clearly on many backgrounds. For this reason, it is not usually necessary to alter the marks before placing them on a color, photograph or complex background.</p>
        <p>EXCEPTIONS</p>
        <p>The all white version of the <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span> should never be used on all white, light or complex backgrounds since none of these backgrounds offers sufficient contrast.</p>
